{"reviewId": "409639308_8cp30IytS", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "目前的经济周期处在通缩的阶段 按本书说的规律 会持续十年 也就是持续到2035年 经济回升 因此这几年处在康波周期的下侧函数", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "4712-4780", "abstract": "康波从萧条向回升的转换本质上就是从滞胀向通缩的转换，此时经济增速不断下降，商品价格明显回落，通缩成为社会的共识，这个过程也有10年之久。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "409639308_8cp30IytS", "userVid": 409639308, "topics": [], "createTime": 1790402985, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 409639308, "name": "Scarlett Lin", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0022-d_vwYPm_2rA5JDxWeCnax10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Scarlett Lin", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "凡所有相 皆为虚妄", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 296297522, "name": "unik", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/iaUXLylSSI7hrs8loxm1vcOg3xcicUT5QfY81o51VEw1VVSCWpJdU9ddiangA5wsUBEISADiaFZVCE8ecxPLCf5eQhQ3U10Yn9E8sH8iaFaibslII/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "你这完全就是根据你看到的这本书的时间来说的吧，真正的通缩从2019年就开始了，只是现在感觉比较明显而已，感觉越明显说明就快到底了。", "reviewId": "409639308_8cp30Iyt